# Lingering Tormentor's persist (CR 702.79a): killed by Bot2's Lightning Bolt with no -1/-1 counter on it, it returns to the
# battlefield under its owner's control with a -1/-1 counter, a 1/1 (the counter is checked). Killed by a second Bolt, now
# with a -1/-1 counter on it, it does not return: it stays in the graveyard.
# Bot1 casts the Tormentor on turn 1 (two Black Lotuses); Bot2 plays Mountain and Mox Ruby on turn 2 and casts both Bolts.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus x2
Lingering Tormentor
Island x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

